"kaliteli</strong>, <strong>dayanıklı</strong> ve <strong>ekonomik "
"çözümler</strong> sunuyoruz. Geniş ürün yelpazemizde <strong>asansör "
"aydınlatma sistemleri</strong>, <strong>fotoseller</strong>, <strong>el "
"tutamakları</strong>, <strong>PVC zemin kaplamaları</strong>, "
"<strong>bakımsız bataryalar</strong>, <strong>asansör fanları</strong> ve "
"çeşitli <strong>mekanik ile elektronik asansör bileşenleri</strong> "
"bulunmaktadır. Müşterilerimizin farklı ihtiyaçlarına özel çözümler "
"geliştirerek <strong>asansör güvenliği, enerji verimliliği ve "
"performansını</strong> artırmayı hedefliyoruz."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Liftkeys</strong> operates in the global market as a Turkey-based, "
"<strong>reliable and innovative elevator parts manufacturer</strong>. We "
"offer <strong>high-quality</strong>, <strong>durable</strong>, and "
"<strong>economical solutions</strong> to elevator companies worldwide. Our "
"wide product range includes <strong>elevator lighting systems</strong>, "
"<strong>photocells</strong>, <strong>handrails</strong>, <strong>PVC floor "
"coverings</strong>, <strong>maintenance-free batteries</strong>, "
"<strong>elevator fans</strong>, and various <strong>mechanical and "
"electronic elevator components</strong>. We aim to increase <strong>elevator"
" safety, energy efficiency, and performance</strong> by developing "
"specialized solutions for our customers' different needs."

#: .\crm\templates\preview\index.html:450
msgid "Uzman Kadro"
msgstr "Expert Staff"

#: .\crm\templates\preview\index.html:452
msgid ""
"Deneyimli mühendislerimiz ve uzman üretim ekibimiz ile her projeye özel "
"çözümler sunuyoruz."
msgstr ""
"We offer tailored solutions for every project with our experienced engineers"
" and expert production team."

#: .\crm\templates\preview\index.html:462
