"sabun yeterlidir. Yüzeyi çizmemek için kuru bezle silmeyiniz ve tiner/aseton"
" gibi ağır kimyasallar kullanmayınız."
msgstr ""
"Warm water, a soft sponge, and neutral (non-abrasive) liquid soap are "
"sufficient for cleaning. Do not wipe with a dry cloth to avoid scratching "
"the surface, and do not use heavy chemicals such as thinner/acetone."

